# Don't ship dev-only files when used as a `file:` or `npm pack` dep.
# Critically, `node_modules/` would otherwise get copied wholesale into
# consumers, dragging duplicate copies of React/react-dom/lucide-react
# along with it — causing "Invalid hook call" / white-screen issues.
node_modules/
src/
tsconfig.json
package-lock.json
.eslintrc*
.prettierrc*
*.tsbuildinfo
